<title>USA: U.S. Dec non-farm payrolls rose 262,000.</title>
<headline>U.S. Dec non-farm payrolls rose 262,000.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Labor Department seasonally adjusted jobs data.</p>
<p> In 1,000s--Change	Dec    Nov--(Prev)   Oct-(Prev)  Dec95</p>
<p>  in Nonfarm Payrolls   262    127    118    261   224     237</p>
<p> Jobless Rate (Pct)     5.3    5.3    5.4    5.2   5.2     5.6</p>
