<p> Avg Weekly Hours	34.8   34.5   34.5   34.3   34.3   34.3</p>
<p> Manufacturing Hours   42.0   41.7   41.7   41.7   41.7   41.2</p>
<p> -Overtime Hours	  4.7    4.5    4.5    4.4    4.4    4.2</p>
